# A game loaded in play without the fade, LbaWinSettings: 194 and
# SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/nofadeload: snapcfg's lba.cfg with that
# key and the save of fixtures/snapdoor). The main menu's Load Game
# loads it, grown out of its frame, and L in play lists it and loads it
# again, grown out of its frame too.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 0.3
shot zoom
sleep 12
shot start
key l
sleep 2
shot llist
key Return
sleep 0.3
shot zoom2
sleep 6
shot reloaded
